              "name": "Connie Mathews Stallworth"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I make this on a smaller scale. just use 2-3 cucumbers, preferrably a purple onion if I have it, a tomato and vinegar, salt, sugar (I usually use Splenda) &amp; a small amount of salad oil. Have used apple cider vinegar also. You can \"play\" around with it until you like the proportions."
