              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LindaLou"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my new favorite summer cuke recipe! A nice change from the creamy mix. I used celery salt and some Mediterran salt. Also soaked the cukes in salt for about 20 mins. beforehand. \r\nSecond time making it, I added yellow and red peppers.. yum!",
